--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The DB post-processing and CTC decoding logic in `board/npu_ocr.py` follows
RapidOCR's semantics (limit_side_len / limit_type, box unclipping, the
shrink-then-pad rule for the cls model, greedy CTC decoding).
