--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PaddleOCR  (https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The models used are the PP-OCRv4 detection / recognition / classification
models.  The pre- and post-processing conventions (normalisation, the 48 px
text height, `imgW = 48 * max_wh_ratio`, the DB probability map) follow
PaddleOCR's definitions.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

